[PR #1234] Refactor: Optimize Video Transcoding API for HLS Compatibility

**Description:**
This pull request updates the backend video processing API to efficiently handle HLS segment generation and manifest creation. It includes:
- New endpoint `/api/v1/videos/{id}/hls` for HLS manifest.
- Optimized FFmpeg integration for faster transcoding.
- Error handling improvements for failed segment generation.

